WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.504
The Carters were enjoying a magic show.

2
00:00:08.505 --> 00:00:14.243
"Mr. Amazing does the best tricks!" Oliver said.

3
00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:19.911
"I wish I knew his secrets," Harry said.

4
00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:24.324
The magician asked for a volunteer from the audience.

5
00:00:24.325 --> 00:00:28.072
"You must be brave," he said.

6
00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:31.234
"I'll make you disappear and then—"

7
00:00:31.235 --> 00:00:34.807
Oliver popped up from his seat.

8
00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:38.057
He ran onto the stage.

9
00:00:38.058 --> 00:00:42.523
Mr. Amazing laughed.

10
00:00:42.524 --> 00:00:51.609
"It looks like I already have my volunteer!"

11
00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.293
The magician opened a wooden box.

12
00:00:55.294 --> 00:00:59.152
He spun it around for the audience.

13
00:00:59.153 --> 00:01:03.766
"You can see the box is empty," he said.

14
00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:08.550
"It has only one door, and I'll lock that."

15
00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:12.164
Oliver began to look worried.

16
00:01:12.165 --> 00:01:17.017
The magician whispered something in Oliver's ear.

17
00:01:17.018 --> 00:01:22.741
Oliver waved to the audience and stepped into the box.

18
00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:30.344
Mr. Amazing closed the door and locked it.

19
00:01:30.345 --> 00:01:33.505
"Uh-oh," Mom said.

20
00:01:33.506 --> 00:01:38.809
"Oliver doesn't like the dark."

21
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:47.038
"He doesn't like small spaces either," Emmy said.

22
00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:50.839
The magician spun the box again.

23
00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:57.428
"Oliver really doesn't like spinning," Harry said.

24
00:01:57.429 --> 00:02:02.060
Just then Oliver pounded on the box.

25
00:02:02.061 --> 00:02:07.008
"Help! Let me out!" he shouted.

26
00:02:07.009 --> 00:02:10.128
Mr. Amazing opened the box.

27
00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:13.753
Oliver ran back to his family.

28
00:02:13.754 --> 00:02:19.460
Mom and Emmy hugged him.

29
00:02:19.461 --> 00:02:22.381
But Harry had a question.

30
00:02:22.382 --> 00:02:26.787
"Did you learn the trick's secret?"

31
00:02:26.788 --> 00:02:36.446
Oliver nodded. "Don't get dizzy!"

